# Standard 1.1 tests in a Version 6 file, one per menu entry, then
# escape. The true colour test asks twice for a mouse click on a
# colour, and each is a read of its own, so it takes two more returns;
# the save and restore test keeps its files in the stream's memory and
# is never asked for a name.

